    <!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->
    <section class="faq" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
      <div class="shell">
        <h2 class="section-title" id="faq-title" data-reveal-title>
          <span class="mask-line"><span>FAQ<span class="accent-dot">.</span></span></span>
        </h2>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details class="reveal">
            <summary><span class="lang-id">Apa yang perlu saya siapkan?</span><span class="lang-en">What should I prepare?</span></summary>
            <div class="faq-a">
              <p><span class="lang-id">Logo, foto produk, teks, dan referensi, kalau sudah ada.</span><span class="lang-en">Your logo, product photos, copy and references, if you have them.</span></p>
              <p><span class="lang-id">Belum lengkap? Tidak apa-apa, kita mulai dari brief.</span><span class="lang-en">Not everything ready? That's fine, we start from the brief.</span></p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="reveal">
            <summary><span class="lang-id">Bisa untuk digital dan cetak?</span><span class="lang-en">Digital and print?</span></summary>
            <div class="faq-a">
              <p><span class="lang-id">Bisa. File disiapkan sesuai media: ukuran untuk sosial media atau iklan, dan versi siap cetak sesuai spesifikasi percetakanmu.</span><span class="lang-en">Yes. Files are prepared for where they'll be used: sized for social media or ads, and print-ready to your printer's specs.</span></p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="reveal">
            <summary><span class="lang-id">File apa yang saya terima?</span><span class="lang-en">Which files do I get?</span></summary>
            <div class="faq-a">
              <p><span class="lang-id">Umumnya PNG atau JPG untuk digital dan PDF untuk cetak. Format lain bisa disepakati di awal.</span><span class="lang-en">Usually PNG or JPG for digital and PDF for print. Other formats can be agreed up front.</span></p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="reveal">
            <summary><span class="lang-id">Berapa lama pengerjaannya?</span><span class="lang-en">How long does it take?</span></summary>
            <div class="faq-a">
              <p><span class="lang-id">Tergantung jenis dan jumlah desain. Estimasi waktu disampaikan setelah brief.</span><span class="lang-en">It depends on the type and number of designs. You get a time estimate after the brief.</span></p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="reveal">
            <summary><span class="lang-id">Bagaimana dengan revisi?</span><span class="lang-en">What about revisions?</span></summary>
            <div class="faq-a">
              <p><span class="lang-id">Revisi sesuai yang kamu mau, jumlahnya tidak dibatasi. Kamu bayar hanya setelah desainnya sesuai dengan brief yang kamu sampaikan.</span><span class="lang-en">Ask for as many revisions as you need. You only pay once the design matches the brief you gave.</span></p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="reveal">
            <summary><span class="lang-id">Logo seperti apa yang dibuat?</span><span class="lang-en">What kind of logo do you make?</span></summary>
            <div class="faq-a">
              <p><span class="lang-id">Simple logo: logo sederhana dan rapi untuk UMKM atau usaha yang baru mulai.</span><span class="lang-en">A simple, clean logo for small businesses or ones just starting out.</span></p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="reveal">
            <summary><span class="lang-id">Pembeli dari luar Indonesia?</span><span class="lang-en">Buying from outside Indonesia?</span></summary>
            <div class="faq-a">
              <p><span class="lang-id">Bisa. Bayar dengan PayPal, Visa, Mastercard, atau metode internasional lain.</span><span class="lang-en">Yes. Pay with PayPal, Visa, Mastercard or other international methods.</span></p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="reveal">
            <summary><span class="lang-id">Butuh video atau website juga?</span><span class="lang-en">Need video or a website too?</span></summary>
            <div class="faq-a">
              <p><span class="lang-id">Bisa. Lihat <a href="/products/video-editing-motion/">Video Editing &amp; Motion</a> dan <a href="/products/website-development/">Website Development</a>.</span><span class="lang-en">Yes. See <a href="/products/video-editing-motion/">Video Editing &amp; Motion</a> and <a href="/products/website-development/">Website Development</a>.</span></p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

